Z||000000||jelly2m8||11-23-2001||05:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroFanaticus2:<BR><B>Here's another interior pic   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PB100030_1.JPG">  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey new Game!!,  Lets figure out what year and model this car was. hehe<P> Don't tell us Fiero Faniticus2.<P> Heres my quick scoop,<P> Its obviously has AC, PWD,  It has Cruise, and its an Auto trans car.<P> I say it is an 85, here's why<P> First it's not an 84, the car doesnt have the air vents in the bulkhead.<BR> <BR> It's not an 86-87-88 because it has the door switches in the rear of the door openings ( see that pink wire running the length of the passanger door sill?)<P> It's not an 88, thats the light saddle interior, not Beechwood.<P> That leaves the engine to go. <P> I'm going out on a limb to say it has the 2.5, The throttle cable casing doesn't look thick enough to be for the V6. I could be sure if I could see the connectors for the ECM.<P> I'm gonna guess the car didn't have a sunroof.<P> My guess on color is either white or red, Thats the only 2 colors I seen 85's with the light saddle interior.<P><BR> I think this car was a 85 white or red 4 cylinder automatic coupe, with light saddle interior.<P> Options, Cruise, AC, PWD, rear defrost and deck lid release. <P> <P> Anyone else have more to add, or corrections, lets hear them!.<P> <P>||||reg||1
